{"ts":"2026-08-04T08:44:51.089Z","author":"harness:codex","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"codex","agent_instance":"ecc9554d11d78abfd35454a3","agent_provenance":{"model":null,"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-ykdt4m"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-887: terminal create contract is non-atomic and inconsistent across importer-facing closure metadata"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GitHub issue #887 reports that importers upgrading to 2026.8.3 repeatedly implemented create-then-parse-id-then-close workflows for source records already terminal. Although create can currently satisfy close-reason governance through --resolution, the contract does not present a coherent create-time closure surface for close reason, completion time, expected/actual evidence, and source provenance, and the multi-command fallback is non-atomic and slow."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","area:cli","area:importers","area:sdk","atomicity","github-report","lifecycle","performance"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-08-04T08:44:51.089Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-08-04T08:44:51.089Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:codex"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":300},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A single SDK primitive is authoritative for atomic create-plus-terminal-transition semantics and governance validation; CLI, MCP, contracts, completion, docs, and external package examples expose coherent close reason, completion time, resolution, expected, actual, and source provenance inputs; The mutation receipt is stable and typed; imported terminal records cannot silently degrade to open on parser mismatch or partial failure; Batch and isolated npm/Bun package consumers prove performance and behavior across GitHub, CSV, and Beads importer patterns"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-n7rr"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/environment","value":"pm-cli 2026.8.3 with GitHub, CSV, and Beads external importers"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/repro_steps","value":"Import an already-closed source record while require_close_reason is enabled; compare create flags with close flags and implement the documented fallback across hundreds of records"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"One typed SDK/CLI mutation atomically creates terminal source records with complete author-supplied closure provenance and stable receipt semantics"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"Importers couple to a partial create contract or perform multiple subprocess calls with a crash window and duplicated parsing logic"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/customer_impact","value":"Bulk migrations are slower, non-atomic, and can silently leave terminal source work open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-2ew0w3","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-04T08:44:51.089Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-gzyt2j","kind":"discovered_from","created_at":"2026-08-04T08:44:51.089Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-n7rr","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-04T08:44:51.089Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"},{"id":"pm-usfg","kind":"implements","created_at":"2026-08-04T08:44:51.089Z","author":"harness:codex","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-08-04T08:44:51.089Z","author":"harness:codex","text":"Duplicate check 2026-08-04: all-status searches covered terminal create, require_close_reason, --resolution, importer closure, atomic lifecycle mutation, and create/update/close policy. Closed pm-2ew0w3 fixed contradictory terminal transition policy, but no active item owns the complete atomic importer-facing terminal-create contract described by GitHub #887. GitHub source: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/887"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"52ba457fa9c06e02cd98765714582dd0efa45cdd0955140bf1b17966cc8cf16b","message":""}
